###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - RMSEs for all models (including half-set variants with 98 training and 102 test structures) are given only in the SI; the main text says they are in the meV/atom range except ML(DFT_E) for diamond (10 meV/atom range). The HF, MP2 and CCSD Delta models and the energy-only ML(DFT_E) are not encoded separately.
# - Phonon dispersions, harmonic and VACF densities of states are properties. QNEP is a new registry method (method papers not in the corpus).
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/schonbauer2026.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.
